# Runtime + dev dependencies, mirroring [project.dependencies] and the dev
# extra. bandit and pip-audit are already in that extra, so the security-scan
# step uses this same lock rather than fetching them again. setuptools is
# pinned because dropping the old "--upgrade pip setuptools" prefix would
# otherwise freeze whatever the runner image ships, and pip-audit flags 79.0.1
# for PYSEC-2026-3447. Compile with:
#   uv pip compile requirements/dev.in --generate-hashes --universal \
#     --python-version 3.11 -o requirements/dev.txt
